	"data": "Audio Journal — Sept 22, 2026 (8:29 AM)\n\nOn the way to work. Thinking about how to approach project work realistically.\n\nRealistic Work Schedule\n\nChris is strategizing about how to balance project work (strategy game) with his energy levels and work schedule.\n\nThe realization: Trying to work on the game every day isn't working. By the time he gets home from work, there's no energy left. He needs to stop beating himself up about it and plan realistically.\n\nNew plan:\nMon–Thu: No project work.…",
